  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "lead",
      "text": "在 npm 组织 `@airp` 下，以公共包 `@airp/validate-cli`（bin `airp-validate`）为唯一发布物；发布前对齐版本、跑通质量门禁、用 dry-run 核对 tarball，再从 monorepo 根执行 `pnpm --filter` 发布。",
      "@id": "mezxvis3dk"
    },
    {
      "type": "hero",
      "metrics": [
        {
          "title": "包名",
          "value": "@airp/validate-cli",
          "@id": "ydh6i647ok"
        },
        {
          "title": "当前版本",
          "value": "1.1.0",
          "status": "pass",
          "@id": "h011nweq0j"
        },
        {
          "title": "access",
          "value": "public",
          "status": "pass",
          "@id": "6cuxwrsgoy"
        },
        {
          "title": "Node",
          "value": ">=20.19",
          "status": "pass",
          "@id": "mhjbb20v39"
        }
      ],
      "@id": "1svpng442s"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "范围与结论",
      "lead": "只发布校验 CLI；其它 `@airp/*` workspace 包不单独上架。",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "decision",
          "title": "可发布包边界",
          "context": "`apps/validate-cli` 声明 `publishConfig.access: \"public\"` 且无 `private`；`apps/renderer-cli` 为 `private: true`，不在本方案发布清单内。",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "仅发布 @airp/validate-cli",
              "pros": "与 Skill / npx 消费面一致；workspace 逻辑打进 CLI bundle，无需先发内部库。",
              "cons": "库包不可被外部直接依赖（本阶段不需要）。",
              "@id": "t7qragb49g"
            },
            {
              "label": "同步发布全部 @airp/*",
              "pros": "外部可按包引用。",
              "cons": "扩大表面积与版本协调成本，超出当前 CLI 消费模型。",
              "@id": "8a5kxqzi21"
            }
          ],
          "chosen": "仅发布 @airp/validate-cli",
          "rationale": "Skill 与 `validate-airp.mjs` 只依赖已发布 CLI（PATH 或 `npx @airp/validate-cli`）；tsdown 将 `/^@airp\\//` alwaysBundle，运行时不需要已发布的 `@airp/validate` 等库包。",
          "status": "accepted",
          "@id": "33lneihbs4"
        },
        {
          "type": "decision",
          "title": "依赖进包策略",
          "context": "`tsdown.config.ts`：`alwaysBundle: [/^@airp\\//]`；`neverBundle: [\"jsdom\", \"mermaid\", \"citty\"]`；`ajv` / `ajv-formats` 作为 npm `dependencies` 外置解析。",
          "chosen": "workspace 打进 dist；第三方运行时依赖外置",
          "rationale": "jsdom/mermaid 需保留磁盘资源与 Node 可解析子路径；Ajv 同理。发布物 `files: [\"dist\"]`，安装方只拉 npm 运行时依赖。",
          "status": "accepted",
          "@id": "p133swfc90"
        },
        {
          "type": "constraint",
          "rule": "每次发布前，`apps/validate-cli/package.json` 的 `version` 与 `src/cli.ts` 中 `meta.version` 必须同值。",
          "scope": "版本号",
          "nonNegotiable": true,
          "@id": "zayv8awbza"
        },
        {
          "type": "constraint",
          "rule": "npm 同一版本号不可覆盖；升版后才能再次 `publish`。",
          "scope": "registry",
          "nonNegotiable": true,
          "@id": "z2y8g1228b"
        },
        {
          "type": "constraint",
          "rule": "发布账号必须对 npm 组织 `@airp` 具备 publish 权限；scoped 包使用 `access public`（包内已配置 `publishConfig`）。",
          "scope": "权限",
          "nonNegotiable": true,
          "@id": "0eb6nm1rsp"
        },
        {
