    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "发布流程",
      "lead": "每次升版发布按下列顺序执行；失败即停，不跳过 dry-run。",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mermaid",
          "diagramKind": "flowchart",
          "title": "发布主路径",
          "complexity": "simple",
          "source": "flowchart LR\n  Auth[\"npm login / whoami\"] --> Align[\"对齐 version\"]\n  Align --> Gate[\"fix + test\"]\n  Gate --> Pack[\"pack --dry-run\"]\n  Pack --> Pub[\"pnpm publish\"]\n  Pub --> Verify[\"npx / airp-validate 抽查\"]",
          "@id": "4jqw1f8wd9"
        },
        {
          "type": "flowSteps",
          "steps": [
            {
              "title": "权限与登录",
              "description": "对 `@airp` 有 publish 权限的账号执行 `npm login`（或 `pnpm login`），再用 `npm whoami` 确认。",
              "@id": "gf5v9q1l5x"
            },
            {
              "title": "对齐版本",
              "description": "将 `apps/validate-cli/package.json` `version` 与 `src/cli.ts` `meta.version` 设为同一新版本号（semver）。当前 registry latest 为 `1.1.0`，下一版必须高于它。",
              "@id": "a8rc1be2uf"
            },
            {
              "title": "质量门禁",
              "description": "仓库根执行 `pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli fix` 与 `pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli test`。需要全仓一致时再跑根目录 `pnpm fix` 与 `pnpm test`。",
              "@id": "5fx78tgi10"
            },
            {
              "title": "核对 tarball",
              "description": "`pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli pack --dry-run`：内容应含 `package.json` 与 `dist/`，不含 `src/`、测试与未打包 workspace 源码。",
              "@id": "l16ngjdb3w"
            },
            {
              "title": "发布",
              "description": "`pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli publish --access public`。`prepublishOnly` 会再执行 `pnpm build`。仅演练时加 `--dry-run`。",
              "@id": "alngrj372r"
            },
            {
              "title": "消费验证",
              "description": "`npx --yes @airp/validate-cli --help`；或 `npm i -g @airp/validate-cli` 后跑 `airp-validate --input <file.airp.json>`。",
              "@id": "oaljt63i60"
            }
          ],
          "@id": "717wvxts20"
        },
        {
          "type": "checklist",
          "items": [
            {
              "label": "`npm whoami` 属于 `@airp` 且可 publish",
              "checked": false,
              "status": "pending",
              "@id": "5uq77bghtq"
            },
            {
              "label": "`package.json` version == `cli.ts` meta.version，且高于 registry latest",
              "checked": false,
              "status": "pending",
              "note": "当下两者不一致：`1.1.0` vs `0.1.0`",
              "@id": "i265z6b2t7"
            },
            {
              "label": "`pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli fix` 通过",
              "checked": false,
              "status": "pending",
              "@id": "lvzvjtjbnt"
            },
            {
              "label": "`pnpm --filter @airp/validate-cli test` 通过",
